repository-code: "https://github.com/JustSecret123/Imag-Eval"

abstract: >
  Imag-Eval is a language-grounded framework for interpretable
  Text-to-Image instruction-following evaluation. It evaluates
  compositional visual reasoning skills while controlling for prompt
  complexity and minimizing error propagation during evaluation.

keywords:
  - text-to-image
  - image-generation
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
  - multimodal
  - vision-language
  - instruction-following
  - diffusion-models
  - EMNLP

